T189 - rain-field ownership sampling, two campaigns
Branch experiment/cloud-descriptor-k, parent 9394ac7 (T188). Not merged.
Ultra, raw scale 0.2500, cloud target 480x270, framebuffer 1920x1080,
96 steps, 60 samples per cell, three anchor-bracketed blocks per arm per pose.

Run 1 measured performance and the A/B/C rain masks. Run 2 repeated it with
view 64 (is the field texture filtered at all) and the capture-freshness
check, because three arms returning byte-identical masks needed to be
distinguished from a stale read before it could be believed.

=== RUN 1: arms and ownership cost ===
Run 1's raw client log was removed before run 2 was launched, so the lines below
are transcribed from the campaign report rather than extracted from the file.
Run 2 is the complete record and is the one the report's conclusions rest on.

